WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.001 align:start position:0%
I said it.
I said it right there.

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.035 align:start position:0%
I was like,
"You a woman."

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:04.237
- Mm-hmm.
- "I'm a man."

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:05.638
- Mm-hmm.
- There's a difference--

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.040 align:start size:31% position:69%
Oh, what?

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.608 align:end position:100%
They bumpin' [bleep]
up in here.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:09.675 align:end position:100%
Here it is.
It's going off.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:13.179 align:end position:100%
Yo!
Hey!

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:17.683 align:end position:100%
Which one of y'all
mother[bleep]...

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:19.218 align:start size:34% position:66%
bumped me?

00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:20.719
I did.

00:00:20.819 --> 00:00:23.656
What the [bleep] you gonna do
about it?

00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:25.291 align:start size:34% position:66%
What's up?

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:30.896 align:end position:100%
Oh, I'll tell you
what I'ma do about it!

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.131 align:start position:0%
You don't want
to do this today.

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:33.232 align:start size:34% position:66%
Ooh, yeah.
Yeah, what?

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:34.567 align:end position:100%
You lucky my friend's
holding me.

00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:36.335 align:end position:100%
You lucky,
'cause I'll tear your head off!

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:38.637 align:end position:100%
Don't hold me back, dude!
Don't hold me back!

00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:40.373 align:start position:0%
Oh, okay.
Then go for it.

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:47.580 align:start size:66% position:34%
See, I know, though,

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.882 align:end position:100%
if I were to lunge
at you right now,

00:00:49.982 --> 00:00:51.884 align:end position:100%
my friend right here--
he'd catch me

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:53.285 align:end position:100%
at the last
possible second--

00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:55.455 align:start position:0%
No, no,
no, I won't.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:05.064 align:end position:100%
But my friend does have
the cognizance

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:07.867 align:end position:100%
to tell me I don't need
to be going up

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:11.003 align:end position:100%
and committing capital murder
up in a club tonight.

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:12.638
Oh, no, just knock him
unconscious, dog.

00:01:12.738 --> 00:01:15.074
Bam!

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:16.309 align:start position:0%
You don't have
to kill anybody.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:19.846 align:start position:0%
I mean, no need for that.
That's excessive.

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:21.914
Tear him up.

00:01:22.014 --> 00:01:23.849 align:start size:44% position:56%
I will, but--

00:01:23.949 --> 00:01:27.753
[stammering]
Wait. Let me finish my sentence.

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:30.423 align:start size:44% position:56%
I will, uh...

00:01:32.858 --> 00:01:34.394 align:start size:13% position:88%
Oh!

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:37.430 align:end position:100%
Oh, snap.
You know what?

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.999 align:end position:100%
You lucky my boy's using
his telekinetic powers

00:01:40.099 --> 00:01:41.667 align:end position:100%
to hold me back
right now.

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:43.202
No, I'm not.

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:47.673 align:end position:100%
Well, maybe it's the type
of telekinesis

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:51.611 align:end position:100%
that's a mutant power that you
didn't realize you had

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:54.147 align:start size:69% position:31%
until the moment it--

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:55.481 align:start position:0%
Oh, oh!

00:01:55.581 --> 00:01:56.882 align:start position:0%
I got it.
I see, I see.

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.083 align:start position:0%
So you want me
to hold you back.

00:01:58.184 --> 00:01:59.385 align:start size:34% position:66%
[Bleep]...

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:00.953 align:start size:38% position:63%
[screaming]

00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:02.387 align:start size:44% position:56%
I'm a dragon.

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:03.856 align:end position:100%
Oh, yeah,
I want to rip this.

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:06.058 align:end position:100%
I'm a lion.
I'm a tiger over here.

00:02:06.158 --> 00:02:07.960 align:end position:100%
I'm a bear.
Oh, my.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.428 align:end position:100%
I'll go crazy
on you.

00:02:09.528 --> 00:02:10.830
Oh, I can't believe it.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.365
The man--he's like a tornado
up in here.

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.566 align:start size:63% position:38%
Don't hold me back.

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:15.134
I can't even believe
I can hold him back.

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:16.135 align:start size:38% position:63%
Do it, man!

00:02:16.235 --> 00:02:17.436
I can't believe
I'm this strong!

00:02:17.536 --> 00:02:18.904 align:start size:34% position:66%
Let me go!
Let me go!

00:02:19.004 --> 00:02:20.973
I'm one-arming it.
I can't believe I'm this strong.

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:22.008 align:start size:34% position:66%
Let me go!

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.342
I'ma hold him back
with one finger.

00:02:23.442 --> 00:02:24.944
He's like a little baby.
He can't get past me.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.345
He's like a little--Ow!
What?

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:29.215
- I'm a little baby?
- I'm holding you back, man!

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:30.483
- You're stupid, man!
- I know.

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:31.918 align:end position:100%
I got carried away.
I apologize.

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:33.319
What you mean
you got carried away?

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:35.321 align:end position:100%
You told me to hold you back.
I was holding you back.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:36.422 align:end position:100%
What do you
want me to do?

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:37.757 align:start position:0%
In a fight situation,
no means no,

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:38.757 align:start position:0%
and yes means yes.

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:40.159 align:end position:100%
How would
I have known that?

00:02:40.259 --> 00:02:41.594 align:start position:0%
Oh, wait.
Come on, man, ow.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:42.862 align:start position:0%
Come on, that hurt.

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:43.963 align:start position:0%
And you holding me
back now?

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.598 align:start position:0%
Thank you
very much for that.

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:48.101 align:start position:0%
Okay, well,
just at least change it up.

00:02:48.201 --> 00:02:49.534 align:start position:0%
Okay, now
you listen.

